Fonts: Alegreya and Alegreya Sans
---------------------------------

The web app (web/) serves the Alegreya and Alegreya Sans typefaces from its
own origin, taken from the @fontsource/alegreya and @fontsource/alegreya-sans
packages (5.3.0), Latin subset, woff2 only.

Alegreya: Copyright 2011 The Alegreya Project Authors
(https://github.com/huertatipografica/Alegreya).
Alegreya Sans: Copyright 2013 The Alegreya Sans Project Authors
(https://github.com/huertatipografica/Alegreya-Sans).

Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full
license texts are in third_party/licenses/Alegreya-OFL-1.1.txt and
third_party/licenses/Alegreya-Sans-OFL-1.1.txt.


